        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YMRC-HLD, Yale Expressions Holden Lever with Modern Marcel Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Holden Lever with Marcel Rose is a stunningly modern leverset designed with you in mind. It is easy to order and even easier to install. The Yale Expressions Holden Lever with Modern Marcel Rosette comes packaged as a complete residential leverset that can fit most standard pre-drilled doors. This modern interior door lever is available as a dummy door handle for closets, passage lever, a door lever with privacy lock, and a keyed lever. The Holden Door Lever with Modern Square Rose is available in only the most modern finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Holden Door Lever with Modern Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Holden Leverset with Marcel Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry has a Schlage C keyway.</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YMRC25-HLD-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262432\"><b>Yale YMRC25-HLD Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. \r\nLever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face). \r\nPackage Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. \r\nLatch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior lever engages privacy lock \r\non both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior lever. Package Includes: \r\n2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Keyed:</b> Guarded latchbolt operated from outside by key; inside by lever. Turnbutton on the interior locks outside lever. Outside lever unlocks by key. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Holden Lever with Marcel Rose",
                "description": "The Holden Lever with Marcel Rose is a stunningly modern leverset designed with you in mind. It is easy to order and even easier to install. The Yale Expressions Holden Lever with Modern Marcel Rosette comes packaged as a complete residential leverset that can fit most standard pre-drilled doors. This modern interior door lever is available as a dummy door handle for closets, passage lever, a door lever with privacy lock, and a keyed lever. The Holden Door Lever with Modern Square Rose is available in only the most modern finish colors.",
